This is a pretty easy one, finding a valid palindrome.
Here's my solution to the problem.
class Solution:
    def isPalindrome(self, s: str) -> bool:
        s = s.lower()
        new_s = ''
        for char in s:
            if char.isalnum(): 
                new_s += char
        if new_s == new_s[::-1]:
            return True
        else:
            return False

The time and space complexity is O(N)
